  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable combines the luck path killer move Destined Birth Through Luck with Blood Sea under Longevity Heaven. A huge lump of light rises from the sea like a miniature sun. When it fades, the revived Gu Immortal points toward heaven and earth and shouts that beneath the heavens and above the earth, he is the most dazzling one in sight. Yao Huang names the historical light path cultivator and pseudo venerable title. Light Emperor asks who revived him, greets Giant Sun Immortal Venerable as father, and keeps revising his claim to be the most dazzling once told of living venerables and other pseudo venerables. Giant Sun Immortal Venerable sends him toward a fortuitous encounter in the immemorial two heavens, and Yao Huang hands him prepared light path Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        2274
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
